ies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1718123925467439378":{"a":"<p>@hipturn @cqcqcqdx Why so much power on 27 MHz? US Army MARS on 27.5 MHz or so. Just in case scenario.</p>","m":"<h1>Post 1718123925467439378</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1718123925467439378\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-10-28T04:33:59Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1718125041039102115":{"a":"<p>@hipturn @cqcqcqdx <a href=\"https://www.usarmymars.org/about-army-mars\">usarmymars.org/about-army-mars</a></p>","m":"<h1>Post 1718125041039102115</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1718125041039102115\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-10-28T04:38:25Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>qme</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1718134380697100450":{"a":"<p>Hot take: Soil comes from decay and the excrement of animals. People are literally murdering each other over who pissed on a particular pile of shit first. 🤦‍♂️</p>","m":"<h1>Post 1718134380697100450</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1718134380697100450\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-10-28T05:15:32Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1718134819903660363":{"a":"<p>Hi Jordan. 👋</p>","m":"<h1>Post 1718134819903660363</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1718134819903660363\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2023-10-28T05:17:17Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>eu</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1718137123394457920":{"a":"<p>RT @BobGolen: t.co</p>\n<p><img class=\"media\" src=\"1718137123394457920-F9faEWsW0AA85O9.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed e